<task id="010" project="spaarkeai-compose-r4">
  <metadata>
    <title>Persist w14:paraId into the retained package on ingest (FR-01)</title>
    <phase>1 Backend ingest</phase>
    <gate>blocked</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies BFF `.cs` (tags include bff-api), touches the ingest write path (retained package bytes), carries a seam DoD (ADR-038) — code-review + adr-check MUST run at Step 9.5.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Bounded extension of a single existing KEEP asset (`ComposeBaselineParaIdStamper`) with a clear reference impl to reuse (`ParaIdPreParser`/`AnnotationReanchorService.ExtractParaIds`); no cross-cutting architecture change.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>W1</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <deps>001</deps>
    <tags>bff-api,docx</tags>
    <estimated-effort>1-2 days</estimated-effort>
